      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1 tsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1 bunch"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Season rest-meat with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat olive oil in a large oven-safe pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear rest-meat until browned on all sides. Remove from heat and set aside.",
    "Add garlic, onion, and bell pepper to the pan. Cook until the vegetables are softened.",
    "Add turmeric and ginger to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add tomato sauce and chicken broth to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Return the rest-meat to the pan and cover with a lid.",
    "Transfer the pan to the preheated oven and bake for 1 hour.",
    "Remove the pan from the oven and garnish with fresh parsley."
  ],
